OL,3,ANHS faces more challenging winter than
OL,4,Anormal, health secretary warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS is facing a more challenging
OL,7,Fwinter than normal, the health
OL,8,Fsecretary has said, after multiple
OL,9,Fheatwaves led to its busiest summer on
OL,10,Frecord in England.
OL,12,FYvette Cooper announced #140m funding
OL,13,Fto boost urgent care capacity as part
OL,14,Fof an effort to deal with the impact of
OL,15,Fseasonal illnesses, including flu and
OL,16,Fnorovirus.
OL,18,FThe money will go towards 14 schemes
OL,19,Facross England, including new urgent
OL,20,Fcare centres, ambulance fleets and
OL,21,Fupgrades to emergency departments.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
