OL,3,ANHS faces more challenging winter than
OL,4,Anormal, health secretary warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow health secretary Damian Hinds
OL,7,Fsaid the government needed to act, but
OL,8,Fasked it to explain where the money was
OL,9,Fcoming from. The Royal College of
OL,10,FNursing (RCN) England said the funding
OL,11,Fwas "just another sticking plaster".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/37
