OL,3,APolice officer in hospital after being
OL,4,Ashot in Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer is being treated in
OL,7,Fhospital after being shot in Nottingham
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,11,Fhad approached two suspects in Angel
OL,12,FRow shortly before the incident at
OL,13,F04:50 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe officer is now being treated for a
OL,16,Fwound to his foot, the force said.
OL,18,FDetectives said a firearm was recovered
OL,19,Fand that two suspects, a man and a
OL,20,Fwoman, fled the scene.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/37
