OL,3,APhotos show luxury boat with 50m pool
OL,4,Aand water slides near Kim Jong Un's
OL,5,Asummer retreat
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 80m (263ft) luxury vessel has been
OL,8,Frepeatedly spotted in satellite images
OL,9,Foff North Korea's Wonsan coast from
OL,10,FJuly to mid-October this year.
OL,12,FWhat stands out is the 50m swimming
OL,13,Fpool along the deck, with a cluster of
OL,14,Fwaterslides at one end.
OL,16,FAfter sitting idle for months at a
OL,17,Fmaintenance facility, it relocated in
OL,18,Fearly July to waters off a strip of
OL,19,Fcoastline known as the Kalma Peninsula.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/37
